OL,3,AUS stocks fall further as fears over AI
OL,4,Aintensify                              
OL,6,FBig technology firms connected to AI   
OL,7,Fcontinued to see share prices fall on  
OL,8,FWednesday, with stock in Nvidia and    
OL,9,FAnthropic dropping sharply in early    
OL,10,Ftrading.                               
OL,12,FThe surge in Nvidia shares after boss  
OL,13,FJensen Huang was reinstated was        
OL,14,Ftemporary, and the general stock       
OL,15,Fsell-off continued, with all three main
OL,16,FUS stock market indices down by closing
OL,17,Ftime. The tech-dominated Nasdaq closed 
OL,18,F0.6% lower.                            
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
