OL,3,AUS stocks fall further as fears over AI
OL,4,Aintensify                              
OL,6,FThe declines came amid concerns over   
OL,7,Fthe level and sustainability of AI     
OL,8,Finvestment, which has rattled investors
OL,9,Fin recent weeks.                       
OL,11,FShares in other major tech firms,      
OL,12,Fincluding Amazon, Tesla and Microsoft  
OL,13,Fclosed the day lower, though Meta and  
OL,14,FSpaceX were in positive territory by   
OL,15,Fthe end of the trading day.            
